  "body_html": "<p>Embrace comfort and meaning with the Jeminise Personalized Tree of Life Quilt Set. Featuring the symbolic Yggdrasil design, this quilt provides warmth and a touch of ancient wisdom to your home. It's an ideal choice for a thoughtful gift, offering both beauty and functionality for any special occasion.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Design:</strong> Showcases the amazing Yggdrasil Tree of Life design, symbolizing resilience, strength, and interconnectedness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches) to perfectly suit your needs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Functional as a decorative bedding set, a cozy wrap for reading, or for relaxing on the sofa, suitable for indoor and outdoor use in all seasons.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> A practical and beautiful present for loved ones, perfect for housewarmings, weddings, Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Christmas, or any special occasion.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable; wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat. Microfiber dries quickly and becomes fluffier after washing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes 1 Quilt, with optional pillowcases available.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Features a text input option for personalization.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton, Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Colorful Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw(60x70 inches)| Twin(68x86 inches)| Full(80x90 inches)| Queen (90x90 inches)| King (91x102 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>400</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
